  "privacyRecipients": "Recipients, data, and purposes",
  "privacyRecipientsBody": "• OpenStreetMap Overpass API (overpass-api.de, Kumi Systems, Mail.ru): your location, search radius, and route IDs, to fetch routes and stops. Sent only with your consent.\n• Map tiles (OpenStreetMap, OSM France): the visible map area, to draw the map.\n• Google Maps (only with an API key and the setting on): the visible map area, to draw the map.\n• Place search (Nominatim, Photon): the text you search and a nearby coordinate to rank results, to find destinations.\n• Place search (Apple Maps, on iOS when the query includes Japanese): the text you search, to find a place by its Japanese name. A nearby coordinate is included to prefer closer results.\nBus checks and the number table are computed on your device only. Nothing is sent to Google.",
  "privacyStorage": "Storage on your device",
  "privacyStorageBody": "Route data, its archive, the destination, destination history, saved places, corrected stops, and settings are stored on this device. Route data, saved places, destination history, corrected stops, and settings for the number table, arrival alerts, the keypad, and language are also saved to your own iCloud Drive only when iCloud sync is on. Exported backups contain the same.",
